  "description": "Shin, a serial murderer, has shaken the entire nation of South Korea to its core. Ji-Hu Seo, who lost his father to Shin’s evil deeds, meets another victim: Du-Seok Kim, a former detective who also had his family murdered by Shin. Du-Seok vows to turn Ji-Hu into a human weapon to exact revenge on Shin -- in prison, with his bare hands. \n\n*“Korea has not implemented the death penalty since 1997. With no one else upholding justice, what other choice is there?”* \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
